<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omni cautions shareholders on proposals.</title>
<headline>Omni cautions shareholders on proposals.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omni Media Corp Ltd said on Monday the implementation of proposals which may have an effect on its share price were still pending.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution when dealing in the company's shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
